  {
   "dot": "cyan",
   "title": "Dependencies point inward",
   "items": [
    "Every arrow is an import: adapters to application to domain",
    "internal/arch/solid_test.go fails the build on a reversed edge",
    "Domain, application and pkg use only the standard library"
