  },
  {
   "dot": "violet",
   "title": "Consumer-owned ports",
   "items": [
    "The Renderer owns Simulation, eight small roles in sim_ports.go",
    "Each game sub-package owns its Host; the root implements it",
    "Only cmd imports compose/game; compose builds the concrete types"
